lines=['#+TITLE: Dynamic gxi Paired Results and Reproduction','#+LANGUAGE: en','#+OPTIONS: toc:2 num:nil','','* Current result','The required new-UUID candidate first starts took 15.954 and 18.189 seconds: both failed. Cold deadline acceptance remains open; warm passes do not override this result.',f"The fixed matrix completed {len(rows)} samples: {a['passes']} passed the unchanged fifteen-second gate; {len(a['failures'])} failed. Every sample retains its own natural-exit result and native API trace. A later pass never replaces a failed first use.",'','| Identity family | Block | Cell | First seconds | Repeat seconds | First / repeat gate |','|-----------------+-------+------+---------------+----------------+---------------------|']
